Or more cleanly:
```csharp
var data = ModelReaderWriter.Write(rehydrationToken, ModelReaderWriterOptions.Json, AzureResourceManagerContext.Default);
var lroDetails = JsonSerializer.Deserialize(data.ToMemory().Span, ResourceManagerJsonContext.Default.DictionaryStringString);
```

